msgstr "Šta"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "What WHMCS holds and what the import does with it. Making the plan only reads WHMCS. For very large installs, the console runs the same steps: php console.php clientfence:whmcs-import plan"
msgstr "Šta WHMCS sadrži i šta uvoz radi sa tim. Pravljenje plana samo čita WHMCS. Za veoma velike instalacije konzola izvršava iste korake: php console.php clientfence:whmcs-import plan"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "What the import needs, checked when the plan was made by the PHP that made it (the memory row names it: the website and the console each have their own). The import checks again when it starts, and does not start while a check fails."
msgstr "Šta uvozu treba, provereno kada je plan napravljen, onim PHP-om koji ga je napravio (red o memoriji ga imenuje: sajt i konzola imaju svaki svoj). Uvoz proverava ponovo kad počne i ne počinje dok neka provera pada."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Where WHMCS keeps ticket attachments (WHMCS > Storage Settings). If WHMCS runs on another server, copy the folder to this one first. Files not found there are named in the warnings and show as removed."
msgstr "Gde WHMCS čuva priloge tiketa (WHMCS > Storage Settings). Ako WHMCS radi na drugom serveru, prvo kopirajte fasciklu na ovaj. Datoteke koje tamo nisu pronađene navedene su u upozorenjima i prikazuju se kao uklonjene."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Where the counts differ, the warnings say why."
msgstr "Gde se brojevi razlikuju, upozorenja kažu zašto."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/client/mod_client_contacts_page.html.twig
msgid "Your permissions on this account decide which emails you can share; the account owner can change the others."
msgstr "Vaše dozvole na ovom nalogu određuju koje e-poruke možete da delite; ostale može da menja vlasnik naloga."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_setup.html.twig
msgid "After the right password, a 6-digit PIN goes to the staff member's email. Turning it on first emails you a PIN, so email sending must work."
msgstr "Posle ispravne lozinke, PIN kod od 6 cifara šalje se na e-poštu člana osoblja. Ako ga uključite, prvo vi dobijate PIN kod, pa slanje e-pošte mora da radi."

